# LF endings end-to-end for anything the CT110 deploy ships to a bash
# interpreter (2026-09-18 lesson: a CRLF pipe killed deploy-harness-v2.sh
# with `$'do\r'`).  The runner-side transfer also sha256-verifies both hops,
# but correct line endings in the CHECKOUT are the first line of defence.
scripts/deploy/**/*.sh text eol=lf
scripts/deploy/**/*.py text eol=lf
.github/workflows/*.yml text eol=lf
